The legal texts come from the Assembleia da República de Moçambique:

  Constituição da República (2004), https://www.parlamento.mz/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Constituicao-da-Republica.pdf
  Legislação Básica (Secretariado-Geral da Assembleia da República, 2022),
  https://www.parlamento.mz/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Legislacao_Basica.pdf
  both retrieved 2026-10-28.

The Código Comercial (Decreto-Lei n.º 1/2022) comes from the Boletim da República, I Série, n.º 99, 25 May 2022
(Imprensa Nacional de Moçambique), copy published by the Banco de Moçambique,
https://bancomoc.mz/media/q4kh3wop/decreto-lei-1-2022_25-de-maio_código-comercial.pdf, retrieved 2026-10-30.

The Lei do Trabalho (Lei n.º 13/2023) comes from the Boletim da República, I Série, n.º 165, 2.º suplemento,
25 August 2023 (Imprensa Nacional de Moçambique), copy held by FAOLEX (FAO),
https://faolex.fao.org/docs/pdf/moz221728.pdf, retrieved 2026-10-30.

They are official legislative texts. Mozambique's copyright law, Lei n.º 9/2022 (Lei dos Direitos de Autor e
Direitos Conexos), art. 7(1)(a): "A protecção prevista na presente Lei não se aplica: a) a textos oficiais de
natureza legislativa, administrativa ou judicial, nem às suas traduções oficiais". The Assembleia da República's
site states no licence or terms; the texts are reproduced with the attribution above.

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line;
spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; page numbers, running footers, title, chapter and section headings and
the closing approval and signature formula were left out; and the versions were arranged as git commits credited to
the laws that made each change. The wording of the law was not changed. Neither the Assembleia da República, the Imprensa Nacional, the Banco de Moçambique nor FAO
endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
